I followed the instructions of [Creating your first extension](https://nanobind.readthedocs.io/en/latest/basics.html). Inside a directory, I have 2 files:
- `CMakeList.txt`
  <details>

  ```
  cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.15...3.27)
  project(my_project) # Replace 'my_project' with the name of your project

  if (CMAKE_VERSION VERSION_LESS 3.18)
    set(DEV_MODULE Development)
  else()
    set(DEV_MODULE Development.Module)
  endif()

  find_package(Python 3.8 COMPONENTS Interpreter ${DEV_MODULE} REQUIRED)

